   "spoken": "Here is the surprise: the fianchetto with the pawn to g3. It looks modest, but it is an easy, low-theory system against the Qa5 Scandinavian that catches many players off guard.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "A quiet fianchetto setup can be a practical weapon precisely because opponents don't prepare for it.",
