    "Nge2"
   ],
   "spoken": "The knight develops to e2, not f3 — deliberately, so it does not block the g2-bishop. White's whole plan is to break down Black's c6-pawn and open the long diagonal for that bishop.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "Develop the knight to e2 to keep the fianchettoed bishop's diagonal clear.",
